  857:     "You are not alone: React Source13 runs in a disjoint worktree. Root is sole Main/checkpoint/ownership/shared contract writer. Maximum two active Source cards. Do not delegate further Source writes while React is active; readonly specialist review may use a free slot. Preserve all other work. Own only exact worktree/branch, receipts, temporary roots and57 allowlist.",
