  860:     "Every real executable command has prewritten recipe argv/cwd/relevant sanitized env, raw stdout/stderr and numeric nativeexit. Avoid naming scripts inspect.py/json.py or other stdlib modules. Use UTF8 explicitly. Ledger native failures, setup/launcher errors, expected refusals and skips separately. Never overwrite original failed captures or reset counters.",
  861:     "Use known Python C:/Users/yqyyds/AppData/Local/Python/pythoncore-3.14-64/python.exe -B -X utf8 and Main .local/tools/go1.27.1/go/bin/go.exe with existing .local/tools/gopath/pkg/mod; avoid downloading/replacing tools. Reuse valid compile cache; place large native fixture outputs in own C ASCIIroot to avoid D ACL and disk pressure. Read sparse dependencies before invoking builds to avoid repeated known missing-evaluation failure.",
  862:     "Native tests may fence only clearly task-owned disposable files with exact preimage/restore, no drive/shared/OS/user-root ACL changes, account creation, actual OS reboot or original data/process actions. Missing distinct-SID/privileged/restart resources mark only corresponding evidence branches unavailable; implement and test all possible Source/pure/native fixture paths.",
  863:     "Do not reuse B online marker/private drain ticket for historical C. C-only boot alternative must be separately classified; unknown historical worker/verifier raw Wait remains unknown. A public bool/map/rawhandle cannot authorize operations. Keep evidence holds through actual SQL Commit/Rollback returned before Close; replay-zero and error-path release are required.",
  864:     "All5 upgrades and prepared handoff use the shared normalized identity guard; public unguarded APIs fail before key/provider/template/store. Preserve own pending replacement recovery and deny other pending namespace before any normal startup side effect. No blanket bypass for exact-own permits or closed/copy lease.",
  865:     "One FAILED-only operation changes only the adopted five-version/nine-table/upload set in a schema24/87-app-table fixture. Preserve original Task/consumption/effect/ledger/budget/NoProgress/lease/qualification/schema/history. UNKNOWN money never becomes zero. Existing actual source snapshots are not test data; use owned fixtures and frozen evidence inputs.",
